  "The Wild Machines menu (original scene 15: create 0x27234, init 0x26998, menu 0x25838, draw 0x1f054). It is Club Wired's wheel (data/ui/club_wired.json) with wild_tex and six items; the help line is dark (0xff3c3c3c).",
